        "spya-w8z40d"
      ],
      "title": "The Mythology Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "Anil Seth argues that consciousness is unlikely to come along for the ride as AI gets smarter, because intelligence is not consciousness, brains are not computers, and life itself may matter.",
      "sourceHeading": "The Mythology Of Conscious AI"
    },
    "n0002": {
      "id": "n0002",
      "depth": 1,
      "parent": "n0001",
      "children": [
        "n0003",
        "n0009"
      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-tgnssb",
        "spya-gjy45p"
      ],
      "title": "The dream of artificial minds",
      "gist": "The fantasy of creating artificial humans is reinvented with each new technology, and AI now renews the old question of whether our creations could ever be conscious."
    },
    "n0003": {
      "id": "n0003",
