        "spya-nh8mt7",
        "spya-gxdsbh"
      ],
      "title": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "We are tempted to attribute consciousness to AI because of psychological biases — anthropocentrism, human exceptionalism and anthropomorphism — amplified by language, exponential-change narratives and the lure of techno-rapture.",
      "sourceHeading": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI"
    },
    "n0023": {
      "id": "n0023",
      "depth": 2,
      "parent": "n0022",
      "children": [
        "n0024",
        "n0025",
        "n0026",
        "n0027",
