        "n0029",
        "n0030",
        "n0031"
      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-nh8mt7",
        "spya-xm96be"
      ],
      "title": "Intelligence is not consciousness",
      "gist": "Intelligence is about doing while consciousness is about being, so the fact that AI systems can do things does not mean there is anything it is like to be them."
    },
