        "spya-d3g67c",
        "spya-sk4su6"
      ],
      "title": "The functionalist assumption",
      "gist": "The idea of conscious AI rests on the assumption that the right computation is sufficient for consciousness, an assumption so ingrained it is hard to see as an assumption at all."
    },
