      ],
      "title": "What (Not) To Do?",
      "gist": "Given deep uncertainty, we should not deliberately create conscious AI, we should worry about conscious-seeming AI, and we should recognize that our biases favor false positives over false negatives.",
      "sourceHeading": "What (Not) To Do?"
    },
