      "title": "Soul Machine",
      "gist": "Seth closes by reclaiming the soul as the felt essence of being alive rather than a disembodied algorithm, warning that selling ourselves cheap to machine creations overestimates them and underestimates ourselves.",
      "sourceHeading": "Soul Machine"
    },
